.TH LEANDRO 1 "2026-11-26" "Alicante, Spain" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
leandro \- backend engineer, measures things
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B leandro
.RI [ idea " ...]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
Writes backend code at Luzia, mostly in Python.
.PP
Given an
.IR idea ,
.B leandro
instruments it, waits a few weeks and reports whether it was worth doing.
With no arguments, adds a sensor to something nearby.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The idea was worth it.
.TP
.B 1
The idea was not worth it and a graph was produced.
This is the common case and is not an error.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B HOME
A village in Alicante, Spain.
.TP
.B TZ
Europe/Madrid.
.TP
.B WEATHER
Consulted before flying ultralights.
If unset, no flight is attempted.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/homelab
A small datacenter's worth of hardware, at home.
.SH BUGS
On call for everything in FILES, unpaid.
.PP
The church clock next door runs about 15 seconds fast.
This has been measured.
